<title>USA: ADM cuts Imperial stake to 4.9 pct.</title>
<headline>ADM cuts Imperial stake to 4.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co said Friday it reduced its stake in Imperial Holly Corp to 4.998 percent or 712,300 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Archer Daniels said it most recenlty sold 17,900 shares between June 16 and 25 at $11.75 to $12.00 each.</p>
</text>
